market_analysis_*
# ...except the committed test fixture. output/ and market_analysis_* keep run
# artifacts out of git, which is right — but it meant every real-artifact guard
# in the CD suite skipped on any machine but the one that produced the run, and
# reported green while doing so. This one trimmed run is tracked deliberately.
!tests/fixtures/market_analysis_*.json
competitor_handoff_*
advisory_briefing_*
content_opportunities_*
feasibility_*.md
ai_visibility_*
# ...but the AI-visibility EXPORT source + schema are tracked code, not generated
# artifacts (the generated export is output/ai_visibility_export_<slug>_<ts>.json).
!ai_visibility_export.py
!ai_visibility_export_schema.json
gsc_analysis_*
*.validation.md

